            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>fluffy</code> değişkenlerini oluşturmak için kullandığımız <code>VirtualPet</code> sınıfına <strong>tanım</strong> denir. <code>VirtualPet</code> tanımdır, <code>fluffy</code> ise bir örnektir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;brown&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  legs = \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  lives = \" /><text value=\"&quot;9&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"fluffy = VirtualPet()\" /></content></code></body></html>",
